   "x": 40,
   "y": 122,
   "width": 1600,
   "height": 20,
   "text": "component 08's workstream C:  audit-mode policy engine \u2192 inventory \u2192 owned roles \u2192 prioritise \u2192 fix one role \u2192 validate",
